{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"624251c0a0ef8cc8a7a885422e02fd84cdd6c8f14858b8182d4d4d5a424dc95e","ja":"寝不足オンライン","zh":"睡眠不足Online","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b871f1df0e0c01a865ebc553dc8cd512a0d796d36248ef31d47f7c5101b8b74a","ja":"ふわぁ～～～……ふぅ……。","zh":"哈啊——……呼……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6773380ebdea95dfe2509190686e570a7fad883f8cbea5a8692a0a54b3abaafe","ja":"あ、すみません！\nつい、あくびしちゃって……。","zh":"啊，不好意思！\n忍不住打了个哈欠……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ede27410a2fd69497afbbe20083c2850a9cc6c5fe6973f984e832ed73c735ad4","ja":"大丈夫だよ。今日はもうお仕事もないし。\nもしかして、寝不足なの？","zh":"没事的。今天已经没有工作了。\n你是不是没睡够？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bc2e826e357f061a9e1b942e3c0cd3eedea93e2cf88a8f3cc9049c1bd8b30845","ja":"はい。実はこのごろ、夜遅くまで\nオンラインゲームしちゃって……。","zh":"是的。其实最近我都在玩网络游戏，玩到深夜\n……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4bac6dd2323ca9d35a5455de41a09a62f2c8b9d9c828baec269af9d4cf79c150","ja":"お友達もたくさん増えたから、チャットしながら\nプレイしてるとつい長引いちゃうんですよね～。","zh":"因为朋友也变多了，一边聊天一边玩\n不知不觉就玩得很久了呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3c0390b422ec340875a7010c788a96608135fff3529fbf9a60a7f396f965da72","ja":"協力プレイでレアアイテムを見つけたときなんて、\nすっごく感動しちゃったりして……！","zh":"在协力游玩中发现稀有道具的时候，\n真的会超级感动……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"f0c9aba4a91e952984868b5f6c243de3605a6819d27ca8e1e2e9f0ea9eb13e38","ja":"ふふふっ、充実した時間を\n過ごしているんですね～。","zh":"呵呵呵，正在度过充实的时间\n呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"e1f50c316d78e5cc7e6bac57c50c94707a02d98806aa8f3f10c95457b11cdc34","ja":"オンラインゲームって、\nいろんな人と遊べちゃうんですよね？","zh":"网络游戏啊，\n可以和各种各样的人一起玩对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"35f9912cd1e5a9eee5de99afd4fc782999b1c9fa45e4a3291b1f193d39f611ba","ja":"お家の中にいても、お友達がい～っぱいできて\nすごいですーっ！","zh":"就算待在家里，也能交到好多朋友\n好厉害啊——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"0a9a3007c801eb5af0ea201eb007374516b20f7779232720e496764ef589cb7d","ja":"そうだね！　それに、ゲームを通して結婚した、\nなんて人もいるんだって！","zh":"是啊！而且，据说也有人通过游戏\n结婚了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"c9efd4341a511076f4b974230ee54ae8b667d72a871fd3a2fc825d132e7a7865","ja":"私も聞いたことがあります！　オンラインゲームが\n育む愛……とってもロマンチックですよね♪","zh":"我也听说过！　网络游戏\n孕育的爱情……非常浪漫呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"3e6ba502342b644392a222d15af8abadcf3c6b4971117a2b04846744332140b7","ja":"ゲームの遊び方でなんとなくその人の性格が\n分かって、結婚したいほど絆が深まる……とか？","zh":"从玩游戏的方式就能隐约感觉到那个人的性格\n羁绊深到想结婚……之类的？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"a531b22641db8202662c4380933b05aff1675fef84077e6a3565f4ad3ee3e365","ja":"それ、わかる気がします！　優しい人なら、\nピンチのときに助けてくれそうですし！","zh":"这个我好像能理解！如果是温柔的人，\n感觉遇到困难的时候会来帮我呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"a3179626c7a7091ff4ebc3760814417308c49ffe0e3f894e655ca2eb8d87f494","ja":"いつも自分のことを見守ってくれて……。\n愛が生まれるのも自然だと思います！","zh":"一直都在守护着我……。\n会萌生爱意也是很自然的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"d2c0d25c4923d023a752b6b33c8a490c01b015c9c6957e8b8f4cd812d405ed13","ja":"……あれ？　いつも見守ってくれる優しい人……\nそれって、すぐ近くにいるような……。","zh":"……咦？那个一直默默守护着我的温柔的人……\n怎么感觉，好像就在我身边……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1014.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"fec0ace26066e209c9a2d454920d75b1d6e3119b3e5f9fba6103fee9bc4bb4f9","ja":"……確かに！\nそれって……●●●●プロデューサーさん！","zh":"……确实！\n那不就是……●●●●制作人！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
